{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_2001_047sub", "source_sha256": "61843bb4f5e625b6ea98a51de85dba2c58c1d1ce20ec6603ae8679f5ca0c5b14", "ja": "{$P$}、今日はスポーツシューズの\nCMだろ？　撮影前に、ウォーミングアップしたいな！", "zh": "{$P$}，今天要拍运动鞋的广告吧？\n我想在开拍前先暖身一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_2002_p", "source_sha256": "5988af14f180064454ed2c2d2043d373083d84cfc3646b9a789e91ee72e35288", "ja": "そう言うと思って、自転車を借りてきたぞ。\n俺はこれで並走するから、思う存分走ってくれ。", "zh": "我就知道你会这么说，所以已经借来自行车了。\n我会骑车和你并行的，尽量跑吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_2003_047sub", "source_sha256": "9e9be5f81e3db7b0de9ccd9a676b959b47e957d55168e19f24afc36ece8a7bcd", "ja": "おおっ、さすが{$P$}だな！\nそれじゃ、さっそく行くぜ♪", "zh": "哦哦，真不愧是{$P$}啊！\n那我们就快出发吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_2004_047sub", "source_sha256": "1394a61e95a89bd57efe9185fb67d51ba43766631b7a56b27d98cc23a212aaa6", "ja": "ふー、気持ちいい～♪\nこのままずっと走っててもいいくらいだな！", "zh": "呼──真舒服～♪\n感觉就这样一直跑下去也不成问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_2005_p", "source_sha256": "651a6b53cf1a96daa2ba78a39b619ce2c02b20c94a7ce69134fa6325dcfcab96", "ja": "それは……俺の方が倒れるかもしれないな。\n昴、そろそろ時間だし、引き上げようか。", "zh": "再跑下去……倒下的可能会是我啊。\n昴，时间也差不多了，就到此为止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_2006_047sub", "source_sha256": "82926ce2b7b8eab7f71084b0b4ea3528971625d511b206bb212c790d6eda0e99", "ja": "ちぇっ。でもサンキュな、{$P$}！\n帰ったらレモンのはちみつ漬け、わけてやるよ♪", "zh": "啧，但是谢啦，{$P$}！\n回去之后分你一些蜂蜜腌柠檬吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_047sub_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_047sub_2007_047sub", "source_sha256": "4b64f2b6a0ed22ea7570a6cc3b2cac8e4f813e8e4410c4d31e528711a944e7ac", "ja": "オレの手作りなんだ！　兄ちゃん達にも、\nよく作ってやってるし……だから遠慮しなくていいぜ♪", "zh": "是我亲手做的！我也常常做给哥哥们吃……\n所以不用客气喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
